@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 14
  BorderThickness 1.2
}
skinparam component {
  BorderThickness 1.2
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #64748B
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}
skinparam activity {
  BorderColor #64748B
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  DiamondBorderColor #F97316
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF7ED
}
skinparam partition {
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

start
:读取教师登录、看板查看、资源建设、互动、批改、干预和教研记录;
:按 30/90/180 天窗口过滤证据;
:计算专业投入、数字资源、教学与学习、评估、赋能学习者、促进数字能力;
:生成六维雷达和综合分;
if (教师点击 AI 建议?) then (是)
  :调用大模型生成教学优化建议;
else (否)
  :仅展示量化画像和证据下钻;
endif
:教师查看维度证据时间线;
:教师处理行为继续回流下一次画像;
stop
@enduml
